Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:09.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,宿醉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:10.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莱利娜大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:13.37,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,贝妮亚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.05,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我今天还想再睡一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,有客人找您  大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:21.42,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,客人？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.42,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,就说我身体不舒服让人回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:28.14,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,前来光临的是温奈特公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:31.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:36.38,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,交易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.05,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是关于玉玺的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.93,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,老爷和夫人都出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.26,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,您打算怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:47.96,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.93,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你让他在客厅等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:56.51,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我得好好告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.67,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,告诉他  如果不想暴露自己的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.87,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,就跟我联手  帮忙把这桩婚约解除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.17,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\blur4\4c&H000000&}Save my world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.92,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H7E8086&\blur4}革命のゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.59,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}差し出す一手が勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:17.51,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.14,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}準備はOK？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:37.20,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}迷宮なこの世界に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:39.20,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}蔓延る駒を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.74,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}If I could burn it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.87,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}出口は見つからない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.54,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}深く祈る想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:50.08,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}どこに消えていくの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.92,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}Pray all night long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.17,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}聞こえてますか？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:56.42,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Black & White
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.80,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}マス目の上で微笑む
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:05.43,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}描くの最高のフィナーレ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:08.23,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Survive my world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.23,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}革命のゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.86,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}差し出す一手が勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:16.03,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}才能で勝利を呼ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.74,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Save my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:21.37,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H6E7381&\bord0}片道のレール
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.12,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}後悔なんて知らない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.37,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}何度だって試して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.17,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\&H828487&\bord0}完璧にチェックメイト
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.17,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Save my world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.92,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H7E8086&\blur4}这是革命的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.59,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}胜负在此一举
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:17.51,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.14,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}你准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:37.20,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}在谜团重重的此世之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:39.20,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}将横行的棋子落下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.74,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}If I could burn it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.87,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}寻觅不见出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.54,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}深切祈求的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:50.08,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}到底消失去了哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.92,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}Pray all night long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.17,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}你是否能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:56.42,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Black & White
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.80,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}在棋盘格上微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:05.43,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}绘出的是最激烈的终局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:08.23,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Survive my world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.23,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}这是革命的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.86,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}胜负在此一举
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:16.03,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}靠才能召唤胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.74,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Save my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:21.37,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H6E7381&\bord0}这是单程的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.12,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}不知后悔为何物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.37,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}三番五次地尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.17,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}完美地checkmate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.27,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,欢迎您  温奈特公爵大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:47.21,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,麦米伦小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:50.73,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,昨晚您能安全回家  真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:54.03,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是啊  托您的福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,身体怎么样  看你脸色不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:01.16,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,没有  我只是有点吓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:03.13,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:09.12,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不过  公爵大人能这么快见我是我的光荣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:11.95,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他和昨天简直判若两人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:15.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我一心只想着尽快见到小姐您
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:19.20,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,请原谅我的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,公爵大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,温奈特公爵  就是那个薇薇安夏玛尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:28.01,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,无论如何眉目传情也吸引不到的男人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:31.24,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不仅如此  他还拿着花束来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,果然宿醉之后就是要吃冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:42.60,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你又不能喝  昨天干嘛喝得那么猛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:46.52,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好久不喝了嘛  就想着喝点应该没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:51.40,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为不是自己的身体  我怎么知道酒量多少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:56.57,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以说  温奈特公爵到底是为何而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:58.80,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,艾玛  你也很在意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:03:59.98,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:03.34,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,虽然太详细的我说不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.78,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,昨晚我们在晚宴上偶遇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.80,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,注意到了彼此身上有共通之处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.08,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:15.10,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,进展顺利的话  我们会成为很好的搭档吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:20.35,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那个温奈特公爵和大小姐您吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}说到底也就是商业关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:27.50,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.46,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,首先得要
